{"id":"n15812-2-7","stage":3,"title":"숨기다 · 隐瞒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15812-2-7-1","ko":"지수가 뭔가 나에게 숨기고 있는 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得智秀好像在瞒着我什么。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"뭔가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나에게","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"숨기고","meaning":"隐瞒","explanation":"숨기다：隐瞒；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"숨기다","audio":"/audio/db56368b2a238aaff4e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15812","senseId":"2","lemma":"숨기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"db56368b2a238aaf","term":"숨기다","zh":"隐瞒","audio":"/audio/db56368b2a238aaff4e6.mp3","entryId":"15812","definition":"掩饰某种事实和事情，使其不被别人所知。","pronunciation":["숨기다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1fe6fa09fa17379cbbb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15812-2-7-2","ko":"그럼, 지수를 찾아가서 직접 이야기를 해 봐.","zh":"那就去找智秀，亲自和她谈一谈吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼,","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수를","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지수를","audio":"/audio/e9f75725b9488ce72144.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"찾아가서","meaning":"去，去找，去见，拜访","explanation":"찾아가다：去，去找，去见，拜访；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"찾아가다","audio":"/audio/edb19d5b3755c5e82fe0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71812","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직접","meaning":"亲手，亲自","explanation":"직접：亲手，亲自","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71493","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이야기를","meaning":"聊天，说话","explanation":"이야기：聊天，说话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"2","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"edb19d5b3755c5e8","term":"찾아가다","zh":"去，去找，去见，拜访","audio":"/audio/edb19d5b3755c5e82fe0.mp3","entryId":"71812","definition":"去见某人或去做某事。","pronunciation":["차자가다"]},{"id":"20c483bdda9706e4","term":"직접","zh":"亲手，亲自","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3","entryId":"71493","definition":"没有人或物介入在中间而直接。","pronunciation":["직쩝"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"聊天，说话","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"和别人交流的话。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8313d9a1e50a284c3326.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.068,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15812","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":107,"sequenceScore":2.7933,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那就去找智秀，亲自和她谈一谈吧。","我觉得智秀好像在瞒着我什么。","智秀向我借钱，到现在还没还呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得智秀好像在瞒着我什么。","智秀向我借钱，到现在还没还呢。","那就去找智秀，亲自和她谈一谈吧。"],"answer":2}]}
